      "content": "It sounds like you're grieving a version of yourself, and that loss feels monumental. Your identity is tied to your work, but that doesn't mean your value is tied to those datasets. Even when things feel completely shattered, there is always a way to start rebuilding, even if it's just by taking one small step today. Please remember that your worth as a person exists long before your research achievements.",
