      "content": "The shame you feel is real, but it is a very heavy weight to carry all by yourself. Instead of focusing on the massive void, perhaps you could focus on the immediate, tiny pressure point—just getting through the next hour. You don't have to 'rebuild' your entire future today; you only have to manage the next moment. If the path feels gone, maybe the point is simply to find the quietest, safest place to sit until the next moment arrives.",
